{"id":"d6ac3aab64834c60","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-projection.md","title":"非一致投影归约","display":"df-projection — 非一致投影归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-projection","aliases":["29-df-projection"],"display":"df-projection — 非一致投影归约","depends_on":[],"source_locator":"Definition 11.6, p.172, DjVu scan 187","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页187图像；定义已逐项对照，未作机器形式证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projection — 非一致投影归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 11.6, p.172, DjVu scan 187"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页187图像；定义已逐项对照，未作机器形式证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{+}\">\\(S,T\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\)</span> 为非空有限二进制串上的语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 视为函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(s:n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\(n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf c_0,\\mathsf c_1,\\mathsf p_j,\\mathsf n_j\">\\(\\mathsf c_0,\\mathsf c_1,\\mathsf p_j,\\mathsf n_j\\)</span> 是互异的带标记语法对象，分别用于常值、正输入位及负输入位；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span> 在位值上由下式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-s(j)\">\\(1-s(j)\\)</span> 表示。</li>\n<li>下式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=(p_n)_{n\\geq1}\">\\(p=(p_n)_{n\\geq1}\\)</span> 是函数序列，不附加可计算性或一致性要求。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proj}\">\\(\\operatorname{Proj}\\)</span> 与下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{proj}\">\\(\\mathrm{proj}\\)</span> 分别标记下式定义的投影序列集合与归约关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BLit}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf c_0,\\mathsf c_1\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf p_j,\\mathsf n_j\\mid j&lt;n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BLit}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf c_0,\\mathsf c_1\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf p_j,\\mathsf n_j\\mid j&lt;n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_n:\\mathrm{BLit}_n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_n(\\ell,s)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;\\ell=\\mathsf c_0,\\\\\n1,&amp;\\ell=\\mathsf c_1,\\\\\ns(j),&amp;\\ell=\\mathsf p_j,\\ j&lt;n,\\\\\n1-s(j),&amp;\\ell=\\mathsf n_j,\\ j&lt;n.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_n:\\mathrm{BLit}_n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_n(\\ell,s)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&amp;\\ell=\\mathsf c_0,\\\\\n1,&amp;\\ell=\\mathsf c_1,\\\\\ns(j),&amp;\\ell=\\mathsf p_j,\\ j&lt;n,\\\\\n1-s(j),&amp;\\ell=\\mathsf n_j,\\ j&lt;n.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proj}_k(S,T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{p\\in\\prod_{n\\geq1}\\bigl(\\{0,1\\}^{n^k}\\bigr)^{\\{0,1\\}^{n}}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\exists(\\ell_i)_{i&lt;n^k}\\in\\mathrm{BLit}_n^{n^k}\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\;\\forall i&lt;n^k\\;(p_n(s)(i)=\\operatorname{val}_n(\\ell_i,s)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\;(s\\in S\\leftrightarrow p_n(s)\\in T)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proj}_k(S,T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{p\\in\\prod_{n\\geq1}\\bigl(\\{0,1\\}^{n^k}\\bigr)^{\\{0,1\\}^{n}}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\exists(\\ell_i)_{i&lt;n^k}\\in\\mathrm{BLit}_n^{n^k}\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\;\\forall i&lt;n^k\\;(p_n(s)(i)=\\operatorname{val}_n(\\ell_i,s)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\;(s\\in S\\leftrightarrow p_n(s)\\in T)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\leq_{\\mathrm{proj}}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Proj}_k(S,T)\\ne\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\leq_{\\mathrm{proj}}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Proj}_k(S,T)\\ne\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 11.6，印刷页172、扫描页187。每个长度分量的输出位选择同一个输入位、该位的否定或常值；选择可依赖输入长度与输出位置，不能依赖输入位值。原书按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1,2,\\ldots\">\\(n=1,2,\\ldots\\)</span> 给出分量，本接口因此显式处理非空串；空串未偷偷交由长度零分量处理。带标记对象避免把常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 与输入下标混同。分段定义覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BLit}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BLit}_n\\)</span> 且分支互斥，因此位值确定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{+}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"s:n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf c_0,\\mathsf c_1,\\mathsf p_j,\\mathsf n_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg","display":false},{"tex":"1-s(j)","display":false},{"tex":"p=(p_n)_{n\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proj}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{proj}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BLit}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf c_0,\\mathsf c_1\\}\\cup\\{\\mathsf p_j,\\mathsf n_j\\mid j<n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_n:\\mathrm{BLit}_n\\times\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}_n(\\ell,s)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n0,&\\ell=\\mathsf c_0,\\\\\n1,&\\ell=\\mathsf c_1,\\\\\ns(j),&\\ell=\\mathsf p_j,\\ j<n,\\\\\n1-s(j),&\\ell=\\mathsf n_j,\\ j<n.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proj}_k(S,T)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{p\\in\\prod_{n\\geq1}\\bigl(\\{0,1\\}^{n^k}\\bigr)^{\\{0,1\\}^{n}}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\exists(\\ell_i)_{i<n^k}\\in\\mathrm{BLit}_n^{n^k}\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\;\\forall i<n^k\\;(p_n(s)(i)=\\operatorname{val}_n(\\ell_i,s)),\\\\\n&\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall s\\in\\{0,1\\}^{n}\\;(s\\in S\\leftrightarrow p_n(s)\\in T)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"S\\leq_{\\mathrm{proj}}T\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists k\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Proj}_k(S,T)\\ne\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"n=1,2,\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BLit}_n","display":false}],"bytes":2377,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-projection]]、[[29-df-first-order-projection]]、[[29-df-quantifier-free-projection]] — 非一致投影、fop、qfp"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-projection]]"}],"outgoing":[]}